WEBVTT

00:00:00.910 --> 00:00:02.330
If you desire martyrdom,

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:05.650
then sharpen the iron.

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:06.950
Death has come,

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.130
so charge forth upon the earth.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.610
Leave behind this life, cut

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.830
through the tyrant's vein, vein by vein.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.670
Step upon the head

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:21.950
of the merchants of falsehood.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.030
Do not leave falsehood

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:26.610
to remain unchallenged.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.570
Call it whatever you wish:

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.970
violence, sacrifice,

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.840
revenge, defense, or steadfastness.

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:35.230
Step upon the head

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.510
of the merchants of falsehood.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:40.570
Do not leave falsehood

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:43.170
to remain unchallenged.

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.990
Call it whatever you wish:

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:47.570
violence, sacrifice,

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:50.570
revenge, defense, or steadfastness.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.210
If you desire martyrdom,

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:56.490
then sharpen the iron.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:57.790
Death has come,

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.970
so charge forth upon the earth.

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:04.470
Leave behind this life, cut

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:07.030
through the tyrant's vein, vein by vein.

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:10.070
O Muslim, raise

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.630
a cry that shakes the hearts.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:16.430
With terror, the newborn trembles.

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:18.410
O martyr of truth,

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:21.230
awaken my nation.

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:23.750
Let there be no singing

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.390
except as a song of honor.

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:29.650
If you desire martyrdom,

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:30.970
then sharpen the iron.

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:34.130
Death has come,

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:37.650
so charge forth upon the earth.

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:39.910
Leave behind this life, cut

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:42.950
through the tyrant's vein, vein by vein.

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:46.150
Take my blood as ink,

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:47.690
my skin as paper,

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:50.250
and write upon it a lasting legacy.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.910
O martyr, take my blood

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:56.570
as ink and my skin as paper,

00:01:56.570 --> 00:02:00.230
and write upon it a lasting legacy,

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:02.150
O martyr.

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:05.550
If you desire martyrdom,

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:07.310
then sharpen the iron.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:10.030
Death has come,

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:13.590
so charge forth upon the earth.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:17.030
Leave behind this life, cut

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:20.230
